@startuml 01-use-case
title FoodHub - Use case diagram (Customer app core)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Customer
actor Restaurant
actor Courier
actor Admin

rectangle "FoodHub order core" {
  usecase "Browse menu" as UC_MENU
  usecase "Manage cart\n(add / remove / change quantity)" as UC_CART
  usecase "Undo cart change" as UC_UNDO
  usecase "Restore cart draft\n(after app was killed)" as UC_DRAFT
  usecase "Apply promo code" as UC_PROMO
  usecase "Checkout order\n(delivery / pickup / scheduled)" as UC_CHECKOUT
  usecase "Pay\n(card / e-wallet / COD)" as UC_PAY
  usecase "Track order status\nin real time" as UC_TRACK
  usecase "Edit order items\n(only while CREATED)" as UC_EDIT
  usecase "Cancel order" as UC_CANCEL
  usecase "Refund payment" as UC_REFUND_PAY
  usecase "Request refund\n(within 24h after delivery)" as UC_REFUND
  usecase "Rate order" as UC_RATE
  usecase "Export invoice\n(HTML / CSV)" as UC_INVOICE
  usecase "Receive notification\n(push / SMS / email)" as UC_NOTIFY
  usecase "Confirm order" as UC_CONFIRM
  usecase "Prepare order" as UC_PREPARE
  usecase "Deliver order" as UC_DELIVER
  usecase "Manage promo codes\nand regions" as UC_ADMIN
  usecase "Announce promotion" as UC_ANNOUNCE
}

Customer --> UC_MENU
Customer --> UC_CART
Customer --> UC_DRAFT
Customer --> UC_CHECKOUT
Customer --> UC_TRACK
Customer --> UC_EDIT
Customer --> UC_CANCEL
Customer --> UC_REFUND
Customer --> UC_RATE
Customer --> UC_INVOICE
Customer --> UC_NOTIFY

Restaurant --> UC_CONFIRM
Restaurant --> UC_PREPARE
Courier --> UC_DELIVER
Admin --> UC_ADMIN
Admin --> UC_ANNOUNCE

UC_UNDO .> UC_CART : <<extend>>
UC_PROMO .> UC_CHECKOUT : <<extend>>
UC_CHECKOUT .> UC_PAY : <<include>>
UC_CANCEL .> UC_REFUND_PAY : <<include>>
UC_REFUND .> UC_REFUND_PAY : <<include>>
UC_CONFIRM .> UC_NOTIFY : <<include>>
UC_PREPARE .> UC_NOTIFY : <<include>>
UC_DELIVER .> UC_NOTIFY : <<include>>
UC_ANNOUNCE .> UC_NOTIFY : <<include>>

note bottom of UC_ADMIN
  Admin tooling is outside the Customer app.
  In the code, promo codes come from PromoCatalog and
  regions from RegionRegistry (configured at startup);
  PromoAnnouncer stands in for "Announce promotion".
end note
note bottom of UC_TRACK
  Tracking is not a step of the Restaurant/Courier use cases: it reacts
  to every status change through the Observer (OrderEventPublisher).
end note
note bottom of UC_CONFIRM
  Restaurant and Courier apps are simulated by
  OrderLifecycleService (confirm, startPreparing,
  startDelivery, markDelivered).
end note
@enduml
